  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.23: Resolve email-only contributor aliases to provider accounts for efficient, complete open-PR discovery while preserving exact Git selection. Fix omitted unmerged work in per-repository fallback. Add --provider-login for explicit account selection and actionable incomplete reports when identity is unresolved. Include privacy-safe identity and candidate-repository diagnostics. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.23/CHANGELOG.md",
